      "invariants_checked": [
        "Database connection setup in NewDatabaseWithConfig enforces dialect-appropriate connection pooling (SetMaxOpenConns(1) on SQLite, configurable pool bounds on Postgres/MySQL), WAL journal mode, PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON, and PRAGMA busy_timeout = 5000 without logging raw DSNs.",
        "RunMigrationsWithOptions and GetMigrationVersion redact URL userinfo credentials, percent-escaped/quoted secret variants, and password=... parameters before logging, returning errors, or caching currentMigrationError for /api/v1/system/info.",
        "GetMigrationVersion constructs PostgreSQL URLs via net/url.URL + url.UserPassword + net.JoinHostPort so special characters (@, #, ?, /, %, :, newlines) in DB_USER/DB_PASSWORD/DB_NAME are safely percent-encoded rather than misparsed as hostnames or URL escapes.",
        "SQLite migration runner selects file://migrations/sqlite whenever opts.SQLiteDBPath is set (even when dsn is empty), configures SetMaxOpenConns(1) and PRAGMA busy_timeout = 5000 on the migrator connection, closes driver/sqlDB handles on initialization errors, and clears stale cached migration version state on early open failures.",
        "Zero raw SQL string-interpolation injection vectors in internal/database; full SQLite fresh-install, upgrade, and rollback paths verified under -race with zero weknora/knora/wk_ residues."
      ],
      "findings": [
        {
          "id": "W2-DB-MIGRATIONS-01",
          "severity": "P1",
          "file": "internal/database/migration.go:52-79,106-145,195-244,302-326",
          "summary": "RunMigrationsWithOptions logged and cached unsanitized migrate.New / driver errors (exposing raw DSN passwords containing % escapes, control characters, unescaped URL delimiters, or ?password= query params in logs and CachedMigrationError() surfaced by /api/v1/system/info), selected PostgreSQL migrations/versioned when opts.SQLiteDBPath was set with an empty dsn, leaked driver/sqlDB handles when migrate.NewWithDatabaseInstance failed, left stale cached migration versions on pre-version open failures, and GetMigrationVersion interpolated raw DB_USER/DB_PASSWORD into fmt.Sprintf URLs without URL encoding or error redaction.",
          "regression_test": "TestRunMigrationsRedactsDSNCredentials, TestGetMigrationVersionEncodesAndRedactsCredentials, TestRunMigrationsSQLiteDBPathWithoutSQLiteDSNPrefixAndStateReset",
          "commit": "27c99bedc4104058305ded4790a1a7b3e3f97bca"
        }
      ],
      "verification_commands": [
